-- s 136(3) the proceedings are barred for want of the consent of the Attorney General: expected values follow the text (s 136(3))
#ASSERT `s 136(3) the proceedings are barred for want of the consent of the Attorney General` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- every element of the provision present
