#ASSERT `s 136(1) the punishment on indictment`'s `mode` EQUALS `by indictment`
#ASSERT `s 136(1) the punishment on indictment`'s `maximum imprisonment` EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`
#ASSERT `s 136(1) the punishment on indictment`'s `minimum imprisonment` EQUALS `no imprisonment is stated`
#ASSERT `s 136(1) the punishment on indictment`'s `maximum fine` EQUALS `no fine is stated`

-- s 137 the person fabricates anything to be used as evidence in a judicial proceeding: expected values follow the text (s 137)
#ASSERT `s 137 the person fabricates anything to be used as evidence in a judicial proceeding` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- every element of the provision present
#ASSERT `s 137 the person fabricates anything to be used as evidence in a judicial proceeding` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the person fabricates anything
#ASSERT `s 137 the person fabricates anything to be used as evidence in a judicial proceeding` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the person acts with intent to mislead
#ASSERT `s 137 the person fabricates anything to be used as evidence in a judicial proceeding` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the person acts with intent that it shall be used as evidence in a judicial proceeding, existing or proposed
#ASSERT `s 137 the person fabricates anything to be used as evidence in a judicial proceeding` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the means used is perjury or incitement to perjury

#ASSERT `s 137 the class of the offence` EQUALS `an indictable offence`

#ASSERT `s 137 the punishment on indictment`'s `mode` EQUALS `by indictment`
#ASSERT `s 137 the punishment on indictment`'s `maximum imprisonment` EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`
#ASSERT `s 137 the punishment on indictment`'s `minimum imprisonment` EQUALS `no imprisonment is stated`
#ASSERT `s 137 the punishment on indictment`'s `maximum fine` EQUALS `no fine is stated`

