#ASSERT `s 138(a) the person signs a writing that purports to be an affidavit or statutory declaration sworn or declared before them when it was not` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- every element of the provision present
#ASSERT `s 138(a) the person signs a writing that purports to be an affidavit or statutory declaration sworn or declared before them when it was not` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the person signs a writing that purports to be an affidavit or statutory declaration and to have been sworn or declared before them
#ASSERT `s 138(a) the person signs a writing that purports to be an affidavit or statutory declaration sworn or declared before them when it was not` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the writing was not so sworn or declared / the person knows that they have no authority to administer the oath or declaration
#ASSERT `s 138(a) the person signs a writing that purports to be an affidavit or statutory declaration sworn or declared before them when it was not` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- alternative present: the writing was not so sworn or declared
#ASSERT `s 138(a) the person signs a writing that purports to be an affidavit or statutory declaration sworn or declared before them when it was not` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- alternative present: the person knows that they have no authority to administer the oath or declaration

