#ASSERT `s 138(b) the person uses or offers for use a writing purporting to be an affidavit or statutory declaration that they know was not sworn or declared` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- every element of the provision present
#ASSERT `s 138(b) the person uses or offers for use a writing purporting to be an affidavit or statutory declaration that they know was not sworn or declared` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the person uses or offers for use a writing purporting to be an affidavit or statutory declaration
#ASSERT `s 138(b) the person uses or offers for use a writing purporting to be an affidavit or statutory declaration that they know was not sworn or declared` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the person knows that it was not sworn or declared by the affiant or declarant or before a person authorized in that behalf

