#ASSERT `s 138(c) the person signs as affiant or declarant a writing purporting to have been sworn or declared by them when it was not` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- every element of the provision present
#ASSERT `s 138(c) the person signs as affiant or declarant a writing purporting to have been sworn or declared by them when it was not` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the person signs as affiant or declarant a writing that purports to be an affidavit or statutory declaration and to have been sworn or declared by them
#ASSERT `s 138(c) the person signs as affiant or declarant a writing purporting to have been sworn or declared by them when it was not` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the writing was not so sworn or declared

