#ASSERT `s 138 the person is guilty of an offence under section 138` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- limb s 138(a) made out
#ASSERT `s 138 the person is guilty of an offence under section 138` NOTHING (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- limb s 138(b) made out
#ASSERT `s 138 the person is guilty of an offence under section 138` NOTHING NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- limb s 138(c) made out

